meta {
  name: Restock Suggestions
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/metrics/restock-suggestions
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "params": {
      "alpha": 0.3,
      "recent_days": 7,
      "long_days": 60,
      "safety_days": 2,
      "lead_time_days": 5,
      "coverage_days": 7
    },
    "filters": {}
  }
}

docs {
  Computed metric: weighted daily demand and, per active product, whether to restock and how much.

  Every param is required — each team sends its own business decisions. Optional filters:
  product_ids (string[]) and category (case-insensitive).

  Inventory position = available_stock (already net of reservations) + on_order_stock.

  Response: {metric, params_used, generated_at, data[]}, most urgent first.
  Rejections: INVALID_METRIC_PARAMS (400), naming the offending param.
}
